  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nOnce per turn, during your Main Phase: You
    can Ritual Summon this card, by Tributing monsters from your hand or field whose
    total Levels equal or exceed 1.\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \nYou can Ritual Summon
    this card with \"Miracle Raven\". Must be Ritual Summoned. This Ritual Summoned
    card is unaffected by your opponent's activated effects. If you Ritual Summon
    exactly 1 Ritual Monster with a card effect that requires use of monsters, this
    card you control can be used as the entire Tribute. If this card is Tributed
    for a Ritual Summon: You can add 1 Ritual Monster from your Deck to your hand.
    You can only use this effect of \"Miracle Raven\" once per turn."
